layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Bats, bats, hang up.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/de/Bats%2C_bats%2C_hang_up..png/revision/latest?cb=20251009213925\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/de/Bats%2C_bats%2C_hang_up..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251009213925\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/de/Bats%2C_bats%2C_hang_up..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251009213925 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/de/Bats%2C_bats%2C_hang_up..png/revision/latest?cb=20251009213925 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Bats%2C_bats%2C_hang_up..png\" data-image-name=\"Bats, bats, hang up..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hey_mate.\" title=\"Hey mate.\">Hey mate.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F\" title=\"Is that number got curves?\">Is that number got curves?</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Bats, bats, hang up.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 9 October 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> describes <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a>'s final moments of the <a href=\"/wiki/Do_the_most_accurate_finger_painting_of_the_person_on_the_other_end_of_the_phone\" title=\"Do the most accurate finger painting of the person on the other end of the phone\">Do the most accurate finger painting of the person on the other end of the phone</a> task as \"Bats, bats, hang up\", the episode's title. The title card is of 6 colours of paint on a finger, referencing the same task.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> goes under the spotlight as a livid <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> objects to his actions in a task involving an obstacle course. <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> asks a stranger about their marital status, <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> resorts to bribery, <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> strips to his base layer and <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> destroys a valuable ornament. Throughout it all, <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> expertly maintains order with his usual stern authority.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/5/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/A_possession_that_would_most_confuse_a_future_archaeologist_if_you_were_buried_holding_it\" title=\"A possession that would most confuse a future archaeologist if you were buried holding it\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> A possession that would most confuse a future archaeologist if you were buried holding it.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pull_something_from_that_red_green_onto_this_red_green_using_this_string\" title=\"Pull something from that red green onto this red green using this string\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Pull something from that red green onto this red green using this string. Throughout your pull, you must remain on this red green. Your thing must travel through or over all the obstacles.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_things_genuinely_awkward\" title=\"Make things genuinely awkward\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Make things genuinely awkward.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Do_the_most_accurate_finger_painting_of_the_person_on_the_other_end_of_the_phone\" title=\"Do the most accurate finger painting of the person on the other end of the phone\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do the most accurate finger painting of the person on the other end of the phone. You may only use four-letter words when speaking to them and every other reply will be a lie.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eat_the_lam%C3%A9_duck_or_don%27t_eat_the_lam%C3%A9_duck\" title=\"Eat the lamé duck or don&#39;t eat the lamé duck\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Eat the lamé duck or don't eat the lamé duck. If you are the only person to eat the lamé duck, you win five points and everybody else loses one point. If more than one person eats the lamé duck, all lamé duck eaters lose three points and the lamé duck refusers gain three points. If no one eats the lamé duck, you must each give Greg £25. If everyone eats the lamé duck, Alex will give you each £25.\n</td>\n<td>-3\n</td>\n<td>-3\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>-3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">18\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>Bats, bats, hang up.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920140515\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1003/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26834/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 673/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 8005